{"4258370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Task Force Barbro", "steam_appid": 4258370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Task Force Barbro Real-time tactical infiltration in an alternate Cold War Sweden.</u></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Loop</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Build and manage your resistance cell from a hidden safehouse </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Infiltrate Soviet-occupied zones in real-time first-person missions </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Stealth, sabotage, disguise, extract — or die </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Permadeath is always on • Between missions, manage gear, intel, time, and territory in a turn-based campaign layer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World &amp; Setting</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Alternate timeline: The USSR, ruled by the Kosmos Machine, a sentient ideological AI, occupies Scandinavia • Sweden collapses without resistance. The King vanishes. The U.S. provides questionable “aid.” </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• You lead Task Force Barbro, a stay-behind resistance unit striking from the shadows </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Tactical Cold War thriller with low-tech, high-agency operations </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Philosophy</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• No randomness — success depends on player skill, failure is permanent </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Skills improve efficiency, not action access </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Tools unlock actions, not classes or restrictions </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fully systemic: disguises, traps, and breaches obey grounded logic </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• AI and players follow identical rules </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Emergent storytelling through player choices, intel, and faction dynamics</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Task Force Barbro Real-time tactical infiltration in an alternate Cold War Sweden.</u></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Loop</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Build and manage your resistance cell from a hidden safehouse </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Infiltrate Soviet-occupied zones in real-time first-person missions </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Stealth, sabotage, disguise, extract — or die </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Permadeath is always on • Between missions, manage gear, intel, time, and territory in a turn-based campaign layer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World &amp; Setting</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Alternate timeline: The USSR, ruled by the Kosmos Machine, a sentient ideological AI, occupies Scandinavia • Sweden collapses without resistance. The King vanishes. The U.S. provides questionable “aid.” </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• You lead Task Force Barbro, a stay-behind resistance unit striking from the shadows </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Tactical Cold War thriller with low-tech, high-agency operations </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Philosophy</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• No randomness — success depends on player skill, failure is permanent </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Skills improve efficiency, not action access </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Tools unlock actions, not classes or restrictions </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fully systemic: disguises, traps, and breaches obey grounded logic </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• AI and players follow identical rules </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Emergent storytelling through player choices, intel, and faction dynamics</p>", "short_description": "Task Force Barbro is real-time tactical infiltration in an alternate Cold War Sweden. Build the ultimate Stay-Behind unit, and take up the fight against occupiers and traitors. 